{"text":{"en":{"킹핀 스러스트 베어링 | [회사명] 베어링":"Kingpin Thrust Bearing | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Kingpin Thrust Bearings</p> <h2>킹핀 스러스트 베어링</h2> <p>분리형 스러스트 베어링의 단점을 보완한 조립형(일체형) 스러스트 베어링입니다.</p> <p>차량, 중장비 등 킹핀(조향축) 부위를 비롯한 다양한 용도에 사용됩니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번을 입력하면 검색됩니다. 치수가 \"문의\"로 표시된 형번은 출처가 불충분해 정확한 치수를 싣지 못했으니 견적 문의 바랍니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Kingpin Thrust Bearings</p> <h2>Kingpin Thrust Bearings</h2> <p>An assembled (integrated) thrust bearing that compensates for the drawbacks of separable thrust bearings.</p> <p>Used in a variety of applications, including kingpin (steering shaft) areas of vehicles and heavy equipment.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">Search by entering a model number. For model numbers whose dimensions are marked \"Inquire,\" the source was insufficient to provide exact dimensions, so please make a quote inquiry.</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">구조 단면도 (개념도)</p> <svg viewbox=\"0 0 400 210\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 420px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" aria-label=\"킹핀 스러스트 베어링 단면도\"> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,4,2,4\"></line> <rect x=\"40\" y=\"36\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect> <rect x=\"240\" y=\"36\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect> <g stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"#e7e7e4\"> <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"></circle><circle cx=\"94\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"></circle><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"></circle> <circle cx=\"272\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"></circle><circle cx=\"306\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"></circle><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"></circle> </g> <rect x=\"40\" y=\"88\" width=\"120\" height=\"7\" fill=\"#d8d8d4\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></rect> <rect x=\"240\" y=\"88\" width=\"120\" height=\"7\" fill=\"#d8d8d4\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></rect> <rect x=\"40\" y=\"95\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect> <rect x=\"240\" y=\"95\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"160\"></line><line x1=\"360\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"160\"></line> <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"156\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"156\" marker-start=\"url(#kptArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#kptArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"200\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"132\"></line><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"132\"></line> <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"128\" marker-start=\"url(#kptArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#kptArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"200\" y=\"145\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">d</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"368\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"36\"></line><line x1=\"368\" y1=\"113\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"113\"></line> <line x1=\"374\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"374\" y2=\"113\" marker-start=\"url(#kptArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#kptArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"390\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\" transform=\"rotate(90 390 78)\">B</text> <defs> <marker id=\"kptArrow\" markerwidth=\"6\" markerheight=\"6\" refx=\"3\" refy=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"></path> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 상하 레이스(와셔) + 롤러(니들) 케이지 조립 구조 · d(내경)·D(외경)·B(전체 높이)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">실제 형번별 비례와는 다를 수 있는 구조 개념도이며, 치수값은 아래 표를 따릅니다.</span></p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Structural Cross-Section (Conceptual Diagram)</p> <svg viewbox=\"0 0 400 210\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 420px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" aria-label=\"Kingpin thrust bearing cross-section diagram\"> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,4,2,4\"></line> <rect x=\"40\" y=\"36\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect> <rect x=\"240\" y=\"36\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect> <g stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"#e7e7e4\"> <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"></circle><circle cx=\"94\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"></circle><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"></circle> <circle cx=\"272\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"></circle><circle cx=\"306\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"></circle><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"></circle> </g> <rect x=\"40\" y=\"88\" width=\"120\" height=\"7\" fill=\"#d8d8d4\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></rect> <rect x=\"240\" y=\"88\" width=\"120\" height=\"7\" fill=\"#d8d8d4\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></rect> <rect x=\"40\" y=\"95\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect> <rect x=\"240\" y=\"95\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"160\"></line><line x1=\"360\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"160\"></line> <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"156\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"156\" marker-start=\"url(#kptArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#kptArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"200\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">D</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"132\"></line><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"132\"></line> <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"128\" marker-start=\"url(#kptArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#kptArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"200\" y=\"145\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">d</text> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"> <line x1=\"368\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"36\"></line><line x1=\"368\" y1=\"113\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"113\"></line> <line x1=\"374\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"374\" y2=\"113\" marker-start=\"url(#kptArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#kptArrow)\"></line> </g> <text x=\"390\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\" transform=\"rotate(90 390 78)\">B</text> <defs> <marker id=\"kptArrow\" markerwidth=\"6\" markerheight=\"6\" refx=\"3\" refy=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"></path> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ Upper/lower race (washer) + roller (needle) cage assembly structure · d(bore)·D(outer diameter)·B(overall height)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">This is a conceptual structural diagram that may differ in proportion from actual model numbers; follow the dimension values in the table below.</span></p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">원일베어링(WBC) 카탈로그 제품 사진</p> <img src=\"img/kingpin_thrust.webp\" alt=\"킹핀 스러스트 베어링 제품 사진\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">분리형 스러스트 베어링을 조립형(일체형) 구조로 개선한 제품입니다.</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Wonil Bearing (WBC) catalog product photo</p> <img src=\"img/kingpin_thrust.webp\" alt=\"Kingpin thrust bearing product photo\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">A product that improves upon the separable thrust bearing with an assembled (integrated) structure.</p>","<label for=\"kptFilter\">형번 검색</label> <input id=\"kptFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: TAG12 또는 T-22\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"kptFilter\">Model Number Search</label> <input id=\"kptFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. TAG12 or T-22\" autocomplete=\"off\">","※ 형번 목록은 원일베어링공업(주)(WBC, www.wbc-bearing.co.kr) 회사소개 자료 기준이며, 이 자료에는 치수표가 없어 2곳 이상의 독립된 베어링 판매처·제조사 자료가 일치하는 10개 형번(25TAG11·25TAG12·28TAG12·32TAG12·35TAG12·40TAG12·51104-1·51106-1·51108-1·F-35A)만 인터넷 교차 확인 치수를 실었습니다. 나머지 8개(20TAG12·30TAG12·T-19·T-22·T-28·T-50·T-60·25.4KP)는 출처가 1곳뿐이거나 값이 서로 엇갈려 \"문의\"로 남겼습니다. SWS 자체 카탈로그 수치가 아닌 외부 교차 확인 값이므로 발주 전 재확인 바랍니다.":"* The model list is based on the company profile materials of Wonil Bearing Industry Co., Ltd. (WBC, www.wbc-bearing.co.kr). Since this material does not include a dimension table, we have only listed internet cross-verified dimensions for the 10 model numbers (25TAG11, 25TAG12, 28TAG12, 32TAG12, 35TAG12, 40TAG12, 51104-1, 51106-1, 51108-1, F-35A) where two or more independent bearing distributor/manufacturer sources agreed. For the remaining 8 (20TAG12, 30TAG12, T-19, T-22, T-28, T-50, T-60, 25.4KP), the source was limited to a single reference or the values conflicted, so they are marked \"Inquire.\" These are externally cross-verified values, not figures from SWS's own catalog, so please reconfirm before ordering.","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">구조 단면도 (개념도)</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 210\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 420px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" aria-label=\"킹핀 스러스트 베어링 단면도\"> <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,4,2,4\"> <rect x=\"40\" y=\"36\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <rect x=\"240\" y=\"36\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"> <g stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" fill=\"#e7e7e4\"> <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"><circle cx=\"94\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"> <circle cx=\"272\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"><circle cx=\"306\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"72\" r=\"15\"> </g> <rect x=\"40\" y=\